CDialogTree
{
Name=Mine Foreman
Portrait=!None
Should Have Voiceovers=0
Default Canceled Node Action=
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=1 the foreman challenges you
Text=Far enough. <Behind him, every bow in the dark comes up at once, and none of them wavers.> This rock is the Horde's rock and the shiny in it is the Horde's shiny. Say what you are before my people decide for you.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=Goblin Horde IS
Reply Text=I wear the Khan's mark. The ore is wanted in Barcelona, and I am the one wanting it.
Go to node ID=20 the khans man
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=Barter moreequal 40
Reply Text=You are holding ore to raise its price and there is no one down here to pay it. I am the buyer you have been waiting on.
Go to node ID=30 the price
Icon=Barter Skill Icon

Requirement=Speech moreequal 40
Reply Text=One pile of rock, out of a cave you cannot sell from. Weigh that against a fight you will be explaining to your Khan.
Go to node ID=40 reasoned past
Icon=Speach Skill Icon

Requirement=Schmooze 7+
Reply Text=You are the only one down here worth talking to, and I would rather deal with you than own the place.
Go to node ID=50 charmed
Icon=Attribute Icon

Requirement=Has Silver Mine Deed
Reply Text=The mine is mine. I have the paper that says so, and a goblin gave it to me.
Go to node ID=90 the paper
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I have come for the silver. Stand aside.
Go to node ID=60 refused
Icon=Quest Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then your people can decide.
Go to node ID=70 combat
Icon=Fight Icon

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Another time, then.
Go to node ID=80 go then
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 the khans man
Text=<He looks at the mark a long moment, and the bows go down before he says anything.> The Khan's. Then it was never ours to keep. Take your weight of it and tell him Nurg did not argue.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
