------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 the price
Text=<Something in him relaxes that has nothing to do with the bows.> A buyer. Four months we sit on rock nobody comes for, and the smith in the valley will not send his own feet. Take it. Tell him Nurg sold it to him, and tell him the price next time.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Mine passage granted
}
Icon=Barter Skill Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=40 reasoned past
Text=<He is quiet for the length of two breaths, which from a goblin with the advantage is a concession.> ...The Khan hears about dead humans in his mine. He does not hear about rock. Go. Take it and be the thing he never hears about.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
