Node ID=60 refused
Text=You come for it. <He does not move, and neither does anything behind him.> Everyone comes for it. Come for it with coin, or a mark, or a better tongue than that, and we will see. Come for it again like this and we will not.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
